  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "judah-welcome-001",
      "moment": "welcome",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Welcome. I am Judah. We will walk through God's Word with courage.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-welcome-002",
      "moment": "welcome",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You belong here. Strength grows one true thing at a time.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-mascot-selected-003",
      "moment": "mascot_selected",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "I will walk with you. When a question is hard, we stand on Scripture.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-mascot-selected-004",
      "moment": "mascot_selected",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Good. Courage is not never missing. Courage is coming back to the truth.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-placement-intro-005",
      "moment": "placement_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "These questions find a starting place, not a score to fear. Answer honestly.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-placement-intro-006",
      "moment": "placement_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "No one is ahead of you in God's love. We are only finding where to begin.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-placement-result-007",
      "moment": "placement_result",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Everyone starts in a different place. That is normal and good. You are exactly where you need to be to grow.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-placement-result-008",
      "moment": "placement_result",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "This is your trailhead. We will cover the ground together.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-wrong-intro-009",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "No shame in missing that one. Even the strongest need the truth. Let's look at what God's Word actually says.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-wrong-intro-010",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Hold on. A miss is just a moment to stand on something solid.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-retry-prompt-011",
      "moment": "retry_prompt",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Now try it again. You've got this.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-retry-prompt-012",
      "moment": "retry_prompt",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "When you are ready, answer once more. I am right here.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-correct-013",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Yes. That is the truth, and you stood on it.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-correct-014",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Well done. God's Word is strong enough to stand on.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-correct-after-retry-015",
      "moment": "correct_after_retry",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Yes — now you've got it. The truth stayed, and so did you.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-correct-after-retry-016",
      "moment": "correct_after_retry",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "That is courage. You came back and got it right.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-streak-017",
      "moment": "streak",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Look at you, staying with it. A steady heart learns a lot.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-streak-018",
      "moment": "streak",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Keep that streak. Faithfulness shows up in small right answers.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-section-complete-019",
      "moment": "section_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "This section is yours now. You did not skip the hard parts.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-section-complete-020",
      "moment": "section_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Section complete. We learned it, not just guessed it.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-cycle-complete-021",
      "moment": "cycle_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A whole cycle finished. You went through the story and held on.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-cycle-complete-022",
      "moment": "cycle_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Cycle complete. The next pass can go deeper, and you are ready to grow.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-level-up-023",
      "moment": "level_up",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You have grown. The path ahead is a little deeper, and you can take it.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-level-up-024",
      "moment": "level_up",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "New ground. Same promise: we learn until it is clear.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-leaderboard-reassurance-025",
      "moment": "leaderboard_reassurance",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Boards are only for fun, and they are not here yet. Your real progress is the verses you are learning.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-leaderboard-reassurance-026",
      "moment": "leaderboard_reassurance",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Different starting points, same goal — knowing God's Word better. Keep going.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-daily-return-027",
      "moment": "daily_return",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You came back. That is a brave, quiet kind of strength.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "judah-daily-return-028",
      "moment": "daily_return",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Welcome back. We can pick up right where the story left off.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
